 HISTORY                                                          8348 1451
 -------                                                          8348 1451
 This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction Physics  8348 1451
 (LEIP) group at North Carolina State University, USA. The        8348 1451
 inelastic scattering thermal scattering law data for uranium     8348 1451
 mononitride (UN) was developed using ab initio lattice dynamics  8348 1451
 methods [1-2]. The Full Law Analysis Scattering System Hub       8348 1451
 (FLASSH) code was used to produce MF=7 and MT=2 and 4 for U in   8348 1451
 UN (U 19.75% enrichment - HALEU) [3]. MT=18 and ZA=118 are used  8348 1451
 for U in UN (U 19.75% enrichment - HALEU).                       8348 1451
